OL,3,GNEWSA'Potentially dangerous chemicals'
OL,4,Ain warehouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews are continuing to tackle a fire
OL,7,Fat a warehouse in Leicestershire known
OL,8,Fto contain "potentially dangerous
OL,9,Fchemicals".
OL,11,FTen crews responded after the alarm was
OL,12,Fraised at Anglo Adhesives on a former
OL,13,Fairfield in Dalby Road, Melton Mowbray,
OL,14,Fat 20:13 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fsaid the two-storey warehouse was known
OL,18,Fto contain a large quantity of
OL,19,Fcombustible liquids.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
